{"unit_id":"tag:0EVZ:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（site）。考虑交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0002>\n由集合预层（presheaves of sets）组成，位于 <MATH_0003> 上，并假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004>，且\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0005> 为单射（injective）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则存在典范的（canonical）特殊三角（distinguished triangle）\n<MATH_0006>\n对 <MATH_0007> 具有函子性（functorial），其中 <MATH_0008> 为第 <REF_0001> 节讨论的上同调（cohomology）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"presheaves of sets","target_term":"集合预层"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范的"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"四预层的图"},{"source_term":"presheaves of sets","target_term":"集合预层","context":"图中的对象"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"层化后的比较映射"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范的","context":"Mayer-Vietoris 三角的典范性"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角","context":"Mayer-Vietoris 三角"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性","context":"构造对导出对象的函子性"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"在预层上定义的上同调"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0EVZ:proof","translation":"由于层化（sheafification）为正合（exact）的，且 <MATH_0001>，可以假设 <MATH_0002> 为层（sheaves），取值于集合（sets）。此外，上同调（cohomology）<MATH_0003> 仅依赖于拓扑斯（topos），而不依赖于底层位点（site）。因此由《位点（Sites）》引理 <REF_0001>，可以将 <MATH_0004> 替换为“更大（larger）”的位点（site），具有次典范（subcanonical）拓扑（topology），使得 <MATH_0005>、<MATH_0006>、<MATH_0007> 和 <MATH_0008>，对某些对象（objects）<MATH_0009>，属于 <MATH_0010> 的。在此情形中，结果由引理 <REF_0002> 得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"larger","target_term":"更大"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"次典范"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化","context":"预层的层化"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"层化的正合性"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"层化后的图中对象"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"层的取值"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"预层上的上同调"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"上同调依赖的拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"原位点及扩大的位点"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"larger","target_term":"更大","context":"原文引号中的位点扩大"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"次典范","context":"扩大位点的拓扑性质"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"位点的拓扑"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"表示图中各层的对象"}],"notes":[]}
