，与前面一样得出结论。\n\n<STRUCT_0016><STRUCT_0017>\n关于 (4)。注意 <MATH_0055>，见 (1) 中的讨论。因此 <MATH_0056> 为平坦（flat）的态射（morphism），在赋环的（ringed）位点（sites）之间，见《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》定义 <REF_0004>。不仅如此，而且清楚地有 <MATH_0057>，作用于 <MATH_0058>-模（modules）时（作为模（module）的拉回（pullback），其底层阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）与底层阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）的拉回（pullback）相同）。\n\n<STRUCT_0018><STRUCT_0019>\n关于 (5)。这由 (2) 和 (4) 中的说明是清楚的。\n\n<STRUCT_0020><STRUCT_0021>\n关于 (6)。这与 (3) 类似。省略细节。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":["K-"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"underlying presheaves","target_term":"底层预层"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的"},{"source_term":"sheaf of rings","target_term":"环层"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"ringed","target_term":"赋环的"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑